  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Rei de Ouros fala de sucesso, prosperidade e prazer de viver.",
      "Ele representa quem construiu algo duradouro e sabe desfrutá-lo.",
      "O foco dele é: valorizar-se sem depender do dinheiro."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The King of Pentacles speaks of success, prosperity and enjoyment of life.",
      "He stands for someone who built something lasting and knows how to enjoy it.",
      "His focus: valuing himself without depending on money."
    ]
  },
